# Structure and naming

## Folders

```text
app/                 # App Router pages only
components/
  auth/              # sign-in dialog, account menu
  marketing/         # navbar, hero, features, CTA
  booking/           # fare estimate + wizard steps
  dashboard/         # customer dashboard shell, tables, settings
  ui/                # design primitives only
lib/
  auth/              # customer session hooks
  models/            # wire-aligned types
  booking/           # flow, eligibility
  dashboard/         # trips, invoices, saved cards
  firebase/
  mapbox/
  env.ts
```

Keep marketing, booking, and dashboard code separate. Do not put domain logic in `page.tsx` files.

## Domain glossary (wire vs UI)

| UI copy | Code / Firestore | Avoid |
|---------|------------------|--------|
| Location (city/market) | `branch`, `branchId`, `branches/{id}` | Calling an office a Location; `locationId` for branch |
| Office | office / fleet `locations/…` | “depot” in new copy |
| Vehicle class | `vehicleClassId`, `vehicle_classes/{id}` | Renaming product slugs |
| Pickup / Drop-off | `pickup`, `dropoff` | `dropOff`, `checkIn`/`checkOut` for trips |
| Pickup time | `scheduledPickupAt` | Inventing parallel schedule fields |
| Add-ons | `addonIds`, `PricingAddon` | `extras` as a second schema |
| Passengers | passenger counts on booking | Calling the account “passenger” |
| Customer | role `customer`, `customerID` on trips | Using “guest” for fare fields |
| Guest | anonymous session only (`isGuest`) | Guest as trip headcount |
| Trip / booking | `trips/{id}`, booking flow | `order`, `cart`, `reservation` as schema |

Wire field names stay one-word / product-canonical (`dropoff`, not `drop_off`). Format labels for display separately.

## Code style (common web standards)

| Kind | Convention | Example |
|------|------------|---------|
| Route segments | `kebab-case` | `/book/trip-details` |
| Component files | `kebab-case.tsx` | `vehicle-class-list.tsx` |
| Components | `PascalCase` | `VehicleClassList` |
| Hooks | `use` + camelCase; file `use-*.ts` | `useBookingFlow` |
| Lib modules | `kebab-case.ts` | `booking-eligibility.ts` |
| Types | `PascalCase` | `QuoteResult` |
| Zod schemas | `camelCase` + `Schema` | `tripDetailsSchema` |
| Booleans | `is` / `can` / `has` | `isVisible`, `canContinue` |
| Handlers | `on*` / `handle*` | `onConfirmBooking` |

Prefer feature prefixes when names collide (`BookingSummary` vs `MarketingHero`). Do not put kit or repo names in identifiers.
